{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "17970285-850c-8d6a-ba65-a41f23c1e87c",
  "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:41:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dominic Cardillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:34:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello, Kevin. My name is Dominic Cardillo. I am calling because I have a big puddle in front of my house, and it is not going away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:34:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a puddle. Where are you, Mr. Cardillo?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:34:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "278 Marsh Street, down the Point. The water, it sits across half of the road. Half, I am not exaggerating."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:34:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 278 Marsh. And when did it rain last? Was this from the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:35:05-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no storm. That is the thing. It has not rained for about one week. Maybe more. And the water is still there. Every day, the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:35:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Huh. So dry weather and it's just sitting there. How deep are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:35:31-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps. My car, I drive through, and the water is up to here on the wheel. The hubcaps, yes? That is what you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:35:48-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, hubcaps, that's right. So, what, five, six inches, something like that. I'm writing that down. Half the road, hubcap deep, no rain for a week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:36:04-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. And I want to know, when did they last come by? The city. To clean the drain, to look. Because I think nobody comes here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:36:21-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at that. Hang on a second, I'm pulling up the street. [pause] Okay, I'm seeing the system here, but I don't have a recent cleaning entry I can read you for that block. I'd have to ask the crew supervisor what they've got on paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:36:50-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So you do not know. This is what I am telling you. Nobody knows, nobody comes. It is every time the same story."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:37:04-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll put it in as a ticket so somebody goes out and looks at the catch basin on your corner, and I'll ask for the last service date too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:37:23-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. But when? Today? Next week? Because a week of this already, and the water is, how you say, standing. It smells a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:37:38-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Standing water, little smell, noted. Realistically they'd look at it early next week, maybe sooner since it's not a storm week and things are calmer. I'd say Monday or Tuesday for a first look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:37:59-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday, Tuesday. Okay. And I tell you something strange. The people next door, they have a rooster. A rooster, on Marsh Street. In the Point! I hear it in the morning, very loud. I do not know if it is allowed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:38:24-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A rooster on Marsh Street, huh. That's a new one. That's not a Public Works thing, though. That'd be animal control or the city's code people. Want me to give you that number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:38:44-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I am not calling about the rooster. I only say, because maybe you think I am making a joke about the street. I am serious about the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:39:02-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I believe you. Okay, let me read this back. 278 Marsh Street, The Point. Water covering about half the road, hubcap deep, not draining, no rain in about a week, some odor. You want to know the last time the drain was cleaned. Sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:39:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:39:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And is this the best number to reach you, the one you're on now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:39:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is my cell. 401-555-0193."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:39:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one nine three, got it. Somebody will call you back with what they find, and the cleaning date if there is one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:40:00-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I hope they call. Because I call before about other things and nothing happens. The road, it floods and everybody drives through and splashes the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:40:17-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's no good. I put a note that it's a repeat complaint about standing water so the supervisor sees it. If it gets deeper or somebody's car stalls out, call right back, and if it's after hours there's an emergency line on the main recording."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:40:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Kevin. I will wait until Tuesday, and then I call again if nobody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:40:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. Have a good weekend, Mr. Cardillo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-12T11:41:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
